window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Rejected by her fated mate. And the chosen omega for his harem.</b></p> <p><b>Carmen</b></p> <p>All I've known is rejection—from my family and the alpha who should've been my fated mate. My mom hates me, and my dads took off when I was seven for another woman.</p> <p>And my so-called \"fated mate,\" Tyler? Yeah, he rejected me years ago.</p> <p>So here I am—a packless omega, juggling my babysitting business and dodging our creepy pack leader, Henry, who just loves adding omegas to his little harem collection.</p> <p>But Henry's at my door with an invitation to his exclusive party, and I'm not exactly thrilled. Fine, I'll go.</p> <p>I plan on making a quick exit at the party, but then... I see him, Tyler.</p> <p>The alpha who rejected me years ago. The one who made me cry that fateful night and hasn't bothered to look back since.</p> <p>And he's glaring at me like I've personally wronged him. What the hell did I ever do to him?</p> <p><b>Tyler</b></p> <p>I've tried to forget her. Tried to put the heartbreak of rejecting her behind me. I thought I could stay away. Thought I could keep my distance and protect her from the evil that is Henry.</p> <p>But when I see Carmen again at Henry's party, all the old feelings flood back, and I'm reminded of just how damn wrong I was.</p> <p>She's all grown up now and voluptuous in all the right places…goddamn.</p> <p>She's mine. And my wolf is going crazy for her, even if my rejection years ago cut her deeper than I ever meant it to.</p> <p>She'll never forgive me. Hell, I don't blame her.</p> <p>I can't hide my feelings anymore—not when Henry's got his sights on her, and her best friend, Logan, thinks he has some claim on her, too. I can't think straight, especially when she bolts from the Alpha Compound.</p> <p>But when I find her frozen in a snow ditch. It's game over. The only way to save her is skin-to-skin contact, and I know exactly what that'll trigger—her omega heat.</p> <p>I've never wanted her more, but I never thought I would have to reject her again—especially now that she's pregnant…</p> <p>Denied by the Alphas <i>is a spicy why-choose romance that includes six alpha males, omega heat, and a guaranteed HEA. No MM. Guaranteed pregnancy, passion, and steamy knotting. An omega who bonds with her fated pack. All six of them.</i></p>"; 
